// log1pf(x) which starves the scheduler; the expf/log1pf pair hides
// the SFU entirely behind memory traffic. So we move the chained
// dependency is the performance issue here, not a
// compute-bound operation; fuse traversal. float2+vectorized ILP keeps
// the arithmetic fully hidden behind memory traffic, winning
